    + CONJ-1260: Improved performance of
      DatabaseMetaData.getExportedKeys
    + CONJ-1256: Fixed issue to ensure correct catalog name is
      returned
- Changes of 3.5.3:
  * Bugs Fixed
    + CONJ-1226: Fixed issue where dates containing zero day or
      month resulted in DateTimeException
    + CONJ-1232: Resolved timestamp string representation
