    + CONJ-1239: Disabled BULK operations when no parameters are
      present
    + CONJ-1240: Fixed connectivity issues with databases that only
      accept TLSv1.3
    + CONJ-1235: Modified redirection option to enable by default
      only when SSL is enabled
- Changes of 3.5.2:
  * Bugs Fixed
    + CONJ-1216: Resolved performance issue when batch processing on
