- Changes of 3.5.1:
  * Notable changes
    + CONJ-1193: Implement parsec authentication
    + CONJ-1207: New HaMode: sequential write, loadbalance read
    + CONJ-1208: Permit bulk for INSERT ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE
      commands for 11.5.1+ servers
  * Bugs Fixed
    + CONJ-1053: Mark waffle-jna dependency optional in module
